      "id": "docs_superpowers_plans_archive_2026_04_21_retention_program_v1_phase_2_daily_play_attempts_extension",
      "label": "GameSession attemptsPerRound / attemptsRemaining / currentAttempts extension",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "Approach A (extend the existing session) was chosen over a parallel DailyController so there is one source of truth for reveal geometry; free mode passes attemptsPerRound: 1 for identical runtime behaviour. Daily sessions are detected by the tuple maxRounds===1 && attemptsPerRound===3 rather than a new sessionKind enum.",
      "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/archive/2026-04-21-retention-program-v1-phase-2-daily-play.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
