      "label": "LauncherModeCard three-state rewrite (unplayed / played / unavailable)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Obsolete blocks \u2014 the 2xl bestScore rendering, the hasPlayed em-dash branch, TAGLINES, the onStart single handler, and the launcher-best test id \u2014 are deleted in the same commits as their replacements per the remove-obsolete-code convention.",
